OL,3,GNEWSAUkrainian refugees are 'doing
OL,4,Atheir best to cope'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than four-and-a-half years on from
OL,7,Fthe start of Ukraine-Russian war, a
OL,8,Fleading figure in Reading's Ukrainian
OL,9,Fcommunity centre has reflected on how
OL,10,Frefugees have assimilated.
OL,12,FMick Polleck said some arrivals have
OL,13,Fmoved out of Reading and into
OL,14,Fneighbouring counties as their lives
OL,15,Fhave progressed since they moved to the
OL,16,FUK.
OL,18,FIt is thought about 2,800 Ukrainians
OL,19,Farrived in Berkshire after the invasion
OL,20,Fin February 2022, but some have decided
OL,21,Fto return home.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
