OL,3,GNEWSAUkrainian refugees are 'doing
OL,4,Atheir best to cope'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They're doing their best to cope given
OL,7,Fthat for the majority of them their
OL,8,Fhusbands, brothers, fathers even, are
OL,9,Fstill back home defending the country.
OL,10,FIt's bittersweet," Polleck said.
